|> For those who care, a Klein Bottle is a shape that is defined as being
|> "a surface which has exactly one side and no edges." It's kinda like a 
|> doughnut (a surface that has 2 sides (inside and out) and no edges). It
|> cannot exist in 3 dimensions, hence the humor (for those of you that are
