You can imagine one by taking a normal tube of glass (open at both ends),
streching the top around and connecting it with the bottom, only instead of
making a doughnut, you go through the side of the container and connect it. 
Kinda like dipping the bottle inside itself.  (Hence the message)  A
'real' klein bottle does not go though the side, but around it via a fourth
dimention.

